    "summary": "This PR removes the VS Code extension's `figlet.defaultFont` setting and `figlet.selectDefaultFont` command in favor of persisting the last used font in global state, adds a dedicated Batch (`::`) comment style, rewrites the FIGPrint WinGet publish workflow to generate the three manifests manually (with yaml-language-server schema headers and per-file upload error checks), reorders the ci.yml version-sync job, and refreshes docs/changelog. Reviewers should concentrate on the WinGet workflow rewrite (trigger paths and manifest content) and on any leftover references to the removed `figlet.defaultFont` / `figlet.selectDefaultFont` identifiers in the extension and package.json. Most of the webview/panel changes are truncated in this diff and were not verifiable.",
